@startuml activity-record-expense
title Activity: record a shared expense with an optional receipt\nFR-004, FR-012 to FR-022, FR-025, FR-026, FR-048; NFR-001, NFR-002, NFR-005, NFR-006, NFR-010, NFR-011
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333

|Member|
start
:Open the expense form in group G;
|Swing UI|
:Load active members of G on a worker
(GroupService.members; FR-004, FR-010);
|Member|
:Enter amount and percentages as typed decimal text (D-4),
date and description;
:Payer defaults to self; participants ticked in listed
order, payer ticked by default and may be unticked (FR-013);
:Choose split method EQUAL or PERCENTAGE;
:Optionally choose one receipt image (FR-017);
|Swing UI|
:Request preview on a worker; show loading (NFR-011);
|ExpenseService|
if (Session member is an active member of G?) then (no)
  |Swing UI|
  :Access-denied state; no group data shown
  (FR-004, NFR-002);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ExpenseService|
:Validate fields: amount 0.01 to 100,000.00 with at most two decimals
(AmountRules, FR-016); description and date present (FR-018),
at least one participant; payer and participants active in G (FR-013),
PERCENTAGE: each > 0, at most two decimals, total exactly 100.00 (FR-015);
if (All fields valid?) then (no)
  |Swing UI|
  :Show field-specific message (and the current
  percentage total); keep every other entry (NFR-005);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ExpenseService|
:SplitCalculator: shares rounded DOWN to the cent,
leftover cents one at a time in listed order,
sum of shares = amount (FR-014, FR-015, NFR-001);
:ApprovalPolicy: approvers = payer + participants - creator (FR-026);
if (At least one approver?) then (no)
  |Swing UI|
  :Refuse: nobody can approve an expense that involves
  only its creator; nothing is saved (US4-AS8);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|Swing UI|
:Show ordered share preview (FR-019, US3-AS11);
|Member|
:Confirm Save;
|Swing UI|
:Allocate operation UUID; disable Save; show loading (NFR-011);
:Call recordExpense(session, opId, draft) on a worker;
|ExpenseService|
if (Receipt chosen?) then (yes)
  |ReceiptStore|
  :Check byte count <= 5,000,000 and decode content
  as JPEG or PNG; extension alone is not trusted (US3-AS13);
  if (Valid receipt?) then (no)
    |Swing UI|
    :Receipt-specific message; other entries kept,
    choosing no receipt remains valid (FR-017);
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
  |ReceiptStore|
  :Stage bytes under the data directory,
  write, force and close the file;
  :Finalize: atomic move to a generated UUID path
  on the same file system (before any DB reference);
  if (Finalize succeeded?) then (no)
    :Delete the staged file;
    |Swing UI|
    :Storage-unavailable message, NOT_COMMITTED,
    entries kept; retry allowed (NFR-010);
    stop
  else (yes)
  endif
else (no)
endif
|ExpenseService|
:CommandRunner: lock group G, open one UnitOfWork;
if (Operation ID already recorded for this member?) then (same request)
  :Recheck access and return the prior result,
  no second expense or notification (US1-AS9);
  |Swing UI|
  :Show the saved result;
  stop
else (new)
endif
|UnitOfWork (H2)|
:Re-check membership of creator, payer and participants;
:Insert Expense PENDING with ordered Shares and the
receipt reference (FR-012, FR-020, FR-025);
:Insert EXPENSE_RECORDED notifications for payer and participants,
excluding the creator (FR-021, FR-022);
:Insert operation result COMMITTED;
:Commit;
if (Commit result?) then (committed)
  |Swing UI|
  :Saved. Group expense list (listExpenses) shows the
  expense PENDING with its ID; balances unchanged
  (FR-025, FR-048, US3-AS12);
  stop
elseif (Commit result?) then (rolled back)
  |ExpenseService|
  :ReceiptStore.discard: remove the
  unreferenced finalized file;
  |Swing UI|
  :Not saved (NOT_COMMITTED); entries kept,
  retry with the same operation ID (NFR-010);
  stop
else (uncertain)
  |ExpenseService|
  :Keep receipt files until references and
  operation status can be checked;
  |Swing UI|
  :Outcome UNKNOWN; disable another save,
  look up the operation ID when the store is available,
  COMMITTED shows saved, absent allows retry (US1-AS9),
  startup reconciliation removes only proven
  unreferenced files (US3-AS14);
  stop
endif
@enduml
